{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10135280","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10135280","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1013528001:0":{"text":"이 영지... 정말 이상하네요.","source_cn":"这片营地还真奇怪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5388BB088B04C5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1013528002:0":{"text":"그러게. 이따금 블랙골드 상회의 화물이 보이긴 하지만, ","source_cn":"确实，虽然偶尔能看到有黑金商会的货物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7680DB8B37BBF22C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013528003:0":{"text":"깃발과 분위기가 전에 보았던 영지와는 전혀 달라.","source_cn":"但旗帜和氛围与之前我们见过的营地都不相同。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16E516308FA310EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013528004:0":{"text":"확실히 그러네. 임무에 지장이 없었으면 좋겠는데.","source_cn":"确实如此，希望不会影响到任务本身。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EBA10B41AC7D60E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1013528005:0":{"text":"듀라신이시여, 저희를 올바른 길로 인도하소서.","source_cn":"艾雅在上，请继续为我们指点迷津吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x591DF399DEBB34B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"